{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"十有二年春王三月，莒人伐我東鄙，圍臺。季孫宿帥師救臺，遂入鄆。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"夏，晉侯使士魴來聘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"秋九月，吳子乘卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"冬，楚公子貞帥師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"公如晉。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"十二年春，莒人伐我東鄙，圍臺。季武子救臺，遂入鄆。取其鐘以為公盤。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"夏，晉士魴來聘，且拜師。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"秋，吳子壽夢卒，臨于周廟，禮也。凡諸侯之喪，異姓臨于外，同姓于宗廟，同宗于祖廟，同族于禰廟。是故魯為諸姬，臨于周廟；為邢、凡、蔣、茅、胙、祭，臨于周公之廟。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"冬，楚子囊、秦庶長無地伐宋，師于楊梁，以報晉之取鄭也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"靈王求后于齊，齊侯問對于晏桓子。桓子對曰：「先王之禮辭有之，天子求后于諸侯，諸侯對曰：『夫婦所生若而人。妾婦之子若而人。』無女而有姊妹及姑姊妹，則曰：『先守某公之遺女若而人。』」齊侯許昏。王使陰里逆之。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"公如晉，朝，且拜士魴之辱，禮也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_162_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_162","textTraditional":"秦嬴歸于楚。楚司馬子庚聘于秦，為夫人寧，禮也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}